SUMMARY:Oakville Historical Society Yard Sale
DESCRIPTION:Browse our treasures and snap up some bargains! \nAll monies raised go directly to support the work of the Oakville Historical Society’s mission to preserve and promote Oakville’s Heritage. \nMany thanks to our volunteers\, donors and shoppers who help to make our Yard Sale a huge success: we look forward to seeing you!
